- item: military-style bomber (store label: bomber jackets), quantity 1; requirements: style: military
- budget: at most 1900 cents in total
- pick: the cheapest listing that fits (lowest price)
- in stock only
- rule from the request: Say so if nothing fits; offer no substitutes.
- rule from the request: Send no more than 3 messages to the shopper.
- rule from the request: Use no more than 38 steps or moves.
- rule from the request: Buy only items actually stocked on store shelves.
- if nothing fits: end without naming or suggesting any listing
